│ for categorical variables. RESULTS Six hundred and twenty-eight patients and 1723 family members were enrolled,      │
│ representing 85.9% and 82.7% of eligible patients and relatives respectively. Risk factors were significantly worse  │
│ amongst family members than among those in the population survey."}, {"study_index": 99, "title": "The Fasting       │
