  TC/HDL ratio, Ho, Lp(a), and fibrinogen), despite achieving statistically significant weight loss."},                 
          {"study_index": 107, "title": "Effects of weight loss on clinic and ambulatory blood pressure in              
  normotensive men", "abstract": "Obesity and physical inactivity are associated with both elevated cardiovascular      
