│ similar manner by ALA and EPA + DHA treatments. The high LA diet increased the levels of DNA adducts of MA when      │
│ compared with the effect of the high OA diet. Our findings indicate that the interpretation of the effect of diet,   │
│ dietary fat or a specific FA on the development of chronic disease is extremely complex."                            │
