│ participants with prevalent depression at baseline, significantly higher BDNF levels were found for those assigned   │
│ to the MeDiet+Nuts. DISCUSSION Adherence to a MeDiet was associated to an improvement in plasma BDNF concentrations  │
│ in individuals with depression."                                                                                     │
