│ afforded by MedDiets remain to be uncovered. We assessed the effect of both supplemented MedDiets on internal        │
│ carotid intima-media thickness (ICA-IMT) and plaque height, the ultrasound features that best predict future         │
│ cardiovascular events, in subjects at high cardiovascular risk. APPROACH AND RESULTS In a PREDIMED subcohort         │
│ (n=175), plaque height and carotid IMT of 3 prespecified segments (ICA, bifurcation, and common) were                │
