│ [0.001 to 0.210 mm]; MedDiet+nuts, -0.091 mm [-0.206 to 0.023 mm]; P=0.047). There were no changes in ICA-IMT or     │
│ plaque after the MedDiet+extra virgin olive oil. CONCLUSIONS Compared with a control diet, consumption of a MedDiet  │
