│     "abstract": "BACKGROUND Hypertension can be prevented by adopting healthy dietary patterns. Our aim was to       │
│ assess the 4-year effect on blood pressure (BP) control of a randomized feeding trial promoting the traditional      │
│ Mediterranean dietary pattern. METHODS The PREDIMED primary prevention trial is a randomized, single-blinded,        │
