│ protein, interleukin-6 (IL6) and endothelial and monocytary adhesion molecules and chemokines (P<0.05; all), whereas │
│ these parameters increased after the LFD intervention (P<0.05; all). In another substudy, we evaluated the long-term │
│ (1 year) effects of these interventions on vascular risk factors in 516 high-risk subjects, as well as the effect of │
