mmol/l, P < 0.05, for low total fat diet; by 0.39 (0.15) mmol/l, P < 0.05, for high unsaturated fat diet), while high 
density lipoprotein cholesterol concentrations after fasting and plasma glucose and insulin concentrations during test 
meals were not modified 

